/ablation
# Run artifacts: quantile archives and model checkpoints. 891 .npz + 118 .pt = 6.3 GB, and 21 of
# them are over GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit, so a push could never have succeeded with
# these in. They are regenerable from the code plus the frozen bundles. The scored JSON records
# and the decision-bearing logs beside them stay tracked (about 10 MB) because they are the
# evidence base every diagnostics/verify_*.py reads. Audit M4, and commit 09b8311.
/results/**/*.npz
/results/**/*.pt
